<title>CHINA: China end-April foreign reserves $115 bln - paper.</title>
<headline>China end-April foreign reserves $115 bln - paper.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's foreign exchange reserves stood at $115 billion at the end of April, the official China Economic Times said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>The newspaper, published by the Development Research Centre of the State Council, or cabinet, gave no further details.</p>
<p>China's foreign exchange reserves stood at $112.06 billion at the end of March.</p>
